summary: Basic/sanity test for rtla-hwnoise
description: |
    Unit test for the rtla hwnoise userspace package.rtla hwnoise collects
    the periodic summary from the osnoise tracer running with interrupts
    disabled. By disabling interrupts, and the scheduling of threads as a 
    consequence only non-maskable interrupts and hardware-related noise is allowed.
contact: Chang Yin <cyin@redhat.com>
test: bash ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
duration: 20m
